<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Grudgelands · Character creation · Layout study 06</title>
<style>
:root{color-scheme:dark;--ink:#ece8db;--muted:#9baba5;--gold:#d0b47b;--edge:#a4b5a327;--panel:#111b1bea;--accent:#adbdac}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#080f11;color:var(--ink);font:15px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif}button,select{font:inherit}button{cursor:pointer;color:inherit}button:disabled{cursor:default}button:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,canvas:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--gold);outline-offset:3px}button{transition:background .15s,border-color .15s,color .15s}button:hover:not(:disabled){background-color:#d3c2981c}h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}button img{pointer-events:none}img.icon{object-fit:contain}
.review{height:38px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 24px;background:#172220;border-bottom:1px solid #b8bea625;font-size:11px;color:#b4c0b8;gap:12px}.review strong{font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#e1d7bb}.review-controls{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}.review button,.review select{font-size:11px;padding:3px 8px;border:1px solid #a5b3a333;background:#0e1716;color:#d9dfd7;border-radius:3px}.review a{color:inherit}
.app{height:calc(100dvh - 38px);min-height:650px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:0 28px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 52% 47%,#26342d50,transparent 65%),#0b1315}
.masthead{height:91px;flex-shrink:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid var(--edge)}.brand{font-family:Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:.2em;font-size:18px;color:#e4d1a8}.brand small{display:block;font:9px/2.2 system-ui;letter-spacing:.37em;color:#889d95}.heading{text-align:right}.heading h1{font:27px/1.3 Georgia,serif;color:#e8e1cf}.heading p{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-top:4px}
.layout{flex:1;min-height:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(245px,22fr) minmax(300px,48fr) minmax(330px,30fr);gap:22px;padding:22px 0 0}
.eyebrow{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);font-weight:600}.left{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;padding-top:5px}.section-label{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}.section-label:after{content:"";height:1px;flex:1;background:var(--edge)}.faction{border:1px solid var(--edge);background:linear-gradient(110deg,#14253499,#101a1bc9);padding:17px 12px 19px;border-radius:3px;position:relative}.faction.throng{background:linear-gradient(110deg,#33202366,#101a1bc9)}.faction h2{font:19px Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 14px 8px;letter-spacing:.02em}.faction-content{display:grid;grid-template-columns:75px 1fr;gap:9px;align-items:center}.banner{width:75px;height:158px;object-fit:contain;filter:drop-shadow(0 8px 7px #0008);align-self:start}.race-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;min-width:0}.race{display:flex;align-items:center;width:100%;height:48px;border:1px solid transparent;border-left:2px solid transparent;background:#090f132e;padding:5px 8px;gap:10px;text-align:left;font-size:14px;border-radius:2px}.race img{width:33px;height:33px;filter:brightness(.86)}.race.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#bda36926,#bda3690b);border-color:#c5ad7530;border-left-color:var(--gold);color:#efdbb3}.race.active img{filter:none}.race.active:after{content:"◆";font-size:7px;color:var(--gold);margin-left:auto}.left-note{color:#84958d;font-size:12px;padding:0 8px;max-width:270px;line-height:1.8}.left-note strong{font-weight:400;color:#c7cabe}.left-note .number{color:var(--gold);font-family:Georgia;font-size:20px;margin-right:5px}
.stage{position:relative;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;border:1px solid #a7b49b29;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;background:#142224;isolation:isolate}.landscape{position:absolute;inset:0;background:#1b2d30;transition:background .4s;z-index:-3}.landscape img{image-rendering:pixelated}.landscape svg{width:100%;height:100%;display:block}.stage:after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#07111433 0,transparent 35%,#0c17144d 68%,#0a1214f5 100%);z-index:-1;pointer-events:none}.stage-heading{padding:23px 25px 0;text-align:center;position:relative;z-index:2}.stage-heading h2{font:38px/1.15 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:.025em;margin:6px 0;color:#f0eadc;text-shadow:0 2px 16px #0006}.stage-heading p{color:#d1d8c8;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}.stage-heading .eyebrow{color:#d3cfaa}.art-note{position:absolute;left:14px;top:12px;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c9cfba8c;z-index:2}.model-area{flex:1;min-height:180px;position:relative;touch-action:none}.model-area canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;position:absolute;inset:0;cursor:grab;touch-action:none}.model-area canvas:active{cursor:grabbing}.model-shadow{position:absolute;width:40%;height:9%;left:30%;bottom:4%;border-radius:50%;background:#060d0a85;filter:blur(11px);opacity:0}.empty{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;padding:25px}.empty .sigil{font:74px Georgia;color:#c3bd8c5e;line-height:1}.empty h3{font:25px Georgia;color:#e0dfc9;margin:20px 0 10px}.empty p{font-size:13px;color:#a8b8a7;max-width:260px}.rotate{height:25px;text-align:center;color:#b3bdae;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.04em;visibility:hidden}.classes{position:relative;padding:9px 21px 21px;z-index:2}.classes .section-label{justify-content:center;font-size:9px;margin-bottom:12px;color:#b1beae}.classes .section-label:before{content:"";height:1px;flex:1;background:var(--edge)}.class-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px}.class-choice{background:#0d191ad9;border:1px solid #a9b59a38;border-radius:3px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:5px;padding:9px 2px;font-size:12px;color:#bdc6bd}.class-choice img{height:32px;width:32px;object-fit:contain}.class-choice.active{border-color:#bca57599;background:linear-gradient(#7563484d,#4b45332e);color:#efdab4;box-shadow:inset 0 -2px #d0b47b}.classes.locked{opacity:.4}.classes.locked button{cursor:default}
.right{min-height:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:13px}.panel{border:1px solid var(--edge);background:linear-gradient(110deg,#172321e6,#111c1cec);border-radius:3px;padding:17px 19px}.panel h2{font:19px/1.2 Georgia,serif;color:#e2dfce}.panel-title{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:12px}.panel-title .eyebrow{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#9aa99f}.appearance{flex-shrink:0}.looks{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}.look-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:92px 25px 1fr 25px;align-items:center;gap:5px;height:31px;font-size:12px}.look-row>label{color:#a9b6ad}.look-row button{height:25px;background:#a8b19909;border:1px solid #a6b69926;color:#c8cfbc;border-radius:2px}.look-value{font-size:11px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px}.swatch{width:12px;height:12px;border:1px solid #d4d3c24d;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;flex-shrink:0}.random{margin-top:11px;height:29px;width:100%;background:#c8c19d09;border:1px solid #aaa98835;color:#c9c8b4;font-size:11px;border-radius:2px}.disabled{opacity:.4}.description{font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:#b4c1b6}.race-info{flex-shrink:0}.race-info h2{margin-bottom:8px}.passive{margin-top:9px;font-size:11px;color:#cabc98;display:flex;gap:7px;line-height:1.5}.passive:before{content:"◆";font-size:7px;padding-top:3px}.class-info{flex:1;min-height:110px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden}.class-info .panel-title{margin-bottom:8px}.role{color:var(--gold);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}.skill-list{margin-top:10px;min-height:0;overflow:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:#5a675744 #0000;padding-right:8px}.skill-group{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#94a69a;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:11px 0 7px}.skill-group:first-child{margin-top:0}.skill-group:after{content:"";flex:1;height:1px;background:var(--edge)}.skill{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;min-height:30px;color:#d1d6c8;font-size:12px}.skill img{height:24px;width:24px;object-fit:contain}.skill-footer{font-size:9px;color:#84958b;margin-top:7px}
.footer{height:80px;flex-shrink:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:22fr 48fr 30fr;gap:22px;align-items:center}.footer-left{font-size:10px;color:#748980}.footer-left button{background:none;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #92a49344;color:#a8b3a4;font-size:11px;padding:0 0 2px}.summary{text-align:center;color:#a9b6a6;font-size:12px}.summary b{font-weight:400;color:#e0d7bf}.summary span{margin:0 10px;color:#8e9a81}.create{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:4px}.create button{width:100%;height:40px;border:1px solid #ceb47e7a;background:linear-gradient(#9174494d,#52463544);color:#efdfbd;font:16px Georgia;border-radius:3px;letter-spacing:.025em}.create button:disabled{opacity:.35;border-color:#9b9b8444;background:#686e5c11}.create small{font-size:9px;color:#93a08e}.toast{position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:100px;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#1c2c25;border:1px solid var(--gold);box-shadow:0 10px 40px #0008;border-radius:4px;padding:15px 22px;z-index:20;max-width:90%;text-align:center;font-size:13px}.hidden{display:none!important}
body[data-banner="above"] .faction-content,body[data-banner="below"] .faction-content{grid-template-columns:1fr}body[data-banner="above"] .banner,body[data-banner="below"] .banner{height:80px;width:48px;justify-self:center}body[data-banner="below"] .banner{order:2}body[data-banner="above"] .race,body[data-banner="below"] .race{height:35px}body[data-banner="above"] .race img,body[data-banner="below"] .race img{height:25px;width:25px}body[data-banner="above"] .faction,body[data-banner="below"] .faction{padding:11px}body[data-banner="above"] .faction h2,body[data-banner="below"] .faction h2{margin-bottom:8px}
dialog{max-width:550px;width:90%;background:#14211f;color:#d5dcce;border:1px solid #b9ac7866;border-radius:4px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 20px 100px #0009;font-size:13px}dialog::backdrop{background:#03090bc9}dialog h2{font:25px Georgia;margin-bottom:16px}dialog p{margin:12px 0}dialog button{background:#cbb78022;border:1px solid #cbb78066;padding:7px 18px;margin-top:10px}dialog a{color:#d7c592}
@media(min-height:950px){.panel{padding:18px 23px}.look-row{height:31px}.appearance .panel-title{margin-bottom:12px}.skill{min-height:35px}.left{gap:24px}.faction{padding:22px 16px}.faction-content{grid-template-columns:85px 1fr}.banner{width:85px;height:180px}.race{height:55px}.stage-heading{padding-top:35px}.stage-heading h2{font-size:45px}}
@media(max-width:1250px){.app{padding:0 18px}.layout{gap:14px;grid-template-columns:minmax(220px,23fr) minmax(280px,44fr) minmax(300px,33fr)}.footer{gap:14px}.panel{padding:14px}.faction{padding:14px 9px}.faction-content{grid-template-columns:60px 1fr;gap:4px}.banner{width:60px;height:148px}.race{font-size:12px;gap:6px;padding:4px}.race img{width:28px;height:28px}.classes{padding:9px 12px 17px}.class-grid{gap:5px}.look-row{grid-template-columns:83px 24px 1fr 24px}.heading h1{font-size:24px}}
@media(max-height:850px) and (min-width:901px){.masthead{height:68px}.layout{padding-top:14px}.app{min-height:600px}.panel{padding:12px 15px}.right{gap:9px}.panel-title{margin-bottom:7px}.look-row{height:27px}.random{margin-top:7px;height:25px}.description{font-size:11px;line-height:1.55}.passive{font-size:10px}.footer{height:65px}.stage-heading{padding-top:26px}.stage-heading h2{font-size:32px}.classes{padding-bottom:13px}.faction{padding-top:12px;padding-bottom:12px}.left{gap:14px}.left-note{font-size:11px}.left-note .number{font-size:16px}}
@media(max-width:900px){.review{height:auto;min-height:38px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:8px 14px}.review-controls{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.app{height:auto;min-height:calc(100dvh - 38px);padding:0 16px}.masthead{height:85px}.brand{font-size:14px}.heading h1{font-size:21px}.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:210px 1fr;gap:14px;padding-top:16px}.stage{min-height:570px}.right{grid-column:1/-1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.appearance{grid-row:span 2}.class-info{max-height:330px;min-height:200px}.race-info{height:auto}.left-note{font-size:11px}.footer{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;height:90px}.footer-left{display:none}.faction-content{grid-template-columns:52px 1fr}.banner{width:52px;height:140px}.faction h2{font-size:18px}.stage-heading h2{font-size:33px}.masthead .heading p{font-size:10px}}
@media(max-width:560px){.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.left{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:9px}.left>.section-label{grid-column:1/-1}.left-note{display:none}.faction h2{font-size:16px}.faction-content{grid-template-columns:40px 1fr;gap:0}.banner{width:40px;height:130px}.race{font-size:11px;height:40px}.race img{width:23px;height:23px}.race.active:after{display:none}.stage{min-height:600px}.right{grid-template-columns:1fr}.appearance{grid-row:auto}.class-info{height:330px}.brand{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.1em}.brand small{font-size:7px}.heading h1{font-size:18px}.summary{font-size:10px}.summary span{margin:0 4px}}
@media(max-height:850px) and (min-width:901px){body[data-banner="above"] .left-note,body[data-banner="below"] .left-note{display:none}}
@media(min-width:901px){.layout{grid-template-rows:minmax(0,1fr)}.left{min-height:0}}
@media(max-height:850px) and (min-width:901px){.left-note{font-size:10px;line-height:1.55}}
/* Each calibrated portrait shares the entire backdrop viewport. */
.stage.calibrated .model-area{position:static}
.stage.calibrated #model{z-index:0}
.stage.calibrated .model-shadow{display:none}
.stage.calibrated .rotate{z-index:2;pointer-events:none}
.stage.calibrated .stage-heading{pointer-events:none}
/* Keep the tall peoples clear of labels when the portrait is vertically cropped. */
@media(max-height:850px),(max-width:900px){
 .stage.calibrated .stage-heading{padding-top:8px}
 .stage.calibrated .stage-heading h2{font-size:30px}
 .stage.calibrated .rotate{height:0;overflow:hidden}
 .stage.calibrated .classes{padding-top:5px;padding-bottom:8px}
 .stage.calibrated .classes .section-label{margin-bottom:6px}
 .stage.calibrated .class-choice{padding:5px 2px;gap:3px}
 .stage.calibrated .class-choice img{width:26px;height:26px}
}
</style></head><body data-banner="side">
<div class="review" lang="de"><strong>LAYOUTSTUDIE 06</strong><div class="review-controls"><a href="portraits.html">Alle Völker</a><a href="comparison.html">Vorher / Nachher</a><span>Banner</span><select id="banner-mode" aria-label="Position der Banner"><option value="side">Neben der Liste</option><option value="above">Über der Liste</option><option value="below">Unter der Liste</option></select><button id="reset">Startansicht</button><button id="notes">Hinweise</button><button id="fullscreen">Vollbild ↗</button></div></div>
<main class="app"><header class="masthead"><div class="brand">GRUDGELANDS<small>YOUR STORY BEGINS HERE</small></div><div class="heading"><h1>Create your character</h1><p>Choose your people. Find your calling.</p></div></header>
<div class="layout">
<aside class="left"><div class="section-label">01 &nbsp; Your people</div><section class="faction accord"><h2>The Accord</h2><div class="faction-content"><img class="banner" id="banner-accord" alt="The Accord — hart banner"><div class="race-list" id="accord-races" role="group" aria-label="The Accord races"></div></div></section><section class="faction throng"><h2>The Throng</h2><div class="faction-content"><img class="banner" id="banner-throng" alt="The Throng — boar banner"><div class="race-list" id="throng-races" role="group" aria-label="The Throng races"></div></div></section><p class="left-note"><span class="number">6</span> peoples. <span class="number">2</span> factions.<br>Your people determine your faction and where your journey begins.<br><strong>Every class is open to every people.</strong></p></aside>
<section class="stage" aria-label="Character preview"><div class="landscape" id="landscape"></div><div class="art-note" lang="de">Gespeicherte Spielszene · Web-Renderer</div><div class="stage-heading"><div class="eyebrow" id="stage-faction">A WORLD WAITING FOR YOU</div><h2 id="stage-race">Your journey begins</h2><p id="stage-place">Six peoples. One world.</p></div><div class="model-area" id="model-area"><div class="model-shadow" id="shadow"></div><canvas id="model" tabindex="0" aria-label="Character model. Drag or use left and right arrow keys to rotate."></canvas><div class="empty" id="empty"><div class="sigil">◇</div><h3>Who will you become?</h3><p>Choose a people on the left to see your character.</p></div></div><div class="rotate" id="rotate">↔ &nbsp; Drag to turn your character</div><div class="classes locked" id="classes"><div class="section-label">02 &nbsp; Your calling</div><div class="class-grid" id="class-grid" role="group" aria-label="Choose a class"></div></div></section>
<aside class="right"><section class="panel appearance"><div class="panel-title"><h2>Make it yours</h2><span class="eyebrow">Appearance</span></div><div class="looks disabled" id="looks"></div><button class="random" id="random" disabled>⤨ &nbsp; Random appearance</button></section><section class="panel race-info"><h2 id="race-title">Your people</h2><p class="description" id="race-description">Choose a people to discover their home and their innate strength.</p><p class="passive hidden" id="passive"></p></section><section class="panel class-info"><div class="panel-title"><h2 id="class-title">Your calling</h2><span class="role" id="class-role"></span></div><p class="description" id="class-description">Your class shapes how you fight and support your companions.</p><div class="skill-list" id="skills" tabindex="0" aria-label="Class skills"></div><div class="skill-footer hidden" id="skill-footer">Talent paths unlock further skills as you grow.</div></section></aside>
</div><footer class="footer"><div class="footer-left"><button id="about">About this preview</button></div><div class="summary" id="summary">Your story starts with a choice.</div><div class="create"><button id="create" disabled>Create character &nbsp; →</button><small>This choice is final.</small></div></footer></main>
<div id="toast" class="toast hidden" role="status"></div>
<dialog id="notes-dialog" lang="de"><h2>Layoutstudie 06</h2><p>Interaktive Vorschau für die Planung. Es wird kein Charakter angelegt und nichts gespeichert.</p><p><b>Ausprobieren:</b> Volk und Klasse wechseln, Aussehen anpassen, Figur drehen. Oben kannst du die drei Bannerpositionen vergleichen. „Startansicht“ zeigt den Einstieg ohne gewähltes Volk.</p><p><b>Vorhandene Assets:</b> Fraktionsbanner, Volks-, Klassen- und Skill-Icons sowie die Charaktertexturen aus dem Spiel. Die Figur nutzt die Körpergeometrie unseres vorhandenen Vorschauwerkzeugs. Darstellung und Beleuchtung sind eine Browserannäherung, kein Luanti-Screenshot.</p><p><b>Perspektivstudie:</b> Bei allen sechs Völkern teilen sich Figur und Kulisse Kamera, Maßstab und Bildausschnitt. Die unterschiedlichen Körpergrößen entsprechen dem Spiel. Die Wegbeläge aller sechs Kulissen sind geprüft. Der Vergleich ist oben verlinkt.</p><p><b>Entwurf:</b> Die sechs Hintergründe sind gespeicherte Szenen aus Spielblöcken und bestehenden Gebäudevorlagen, gerendert mit unserem gemeinsamen Gebäude-Web-Renderer. Die Bäume stammen direkt aus unserem Spielgenerator. Kamera, Aufbau, Baumarten und Seeds stehen in den sechs Szenendateien. Die Kulissen, Beschreibungstexte und das Layout sind Vorschläge. Die schmale Browseransicht dient nur dieser Vorschau; das Spiel-Layout prüfen wir später in Desktop und Web.</p><p><small>Character geometry based on player_api character.b3d: celeron55, MirceaKitsune, Jordach et al., CC BY-SA 3.0. Three.js © 2010–2022 Three.js Authors, MIT. Project art: see repository media credits.</small></p><button id="close-notes">Schließen</button></dialog>
